Java: `s += t.charAt(j)` builds reversed prefix.
PHP: `strrev(substr($t, 0, $i))` does this efficiently.
Java: `s += t.substring(i)` appends suffix.
PHP: `. substr($t, $i)`.

Input format: first int, then string (space or newline separated).
Java `Scanner.nextInt()` then `next()` handles whitespace.

PHP code structure:
